{"id":20185,"artist":"http://www.sitio.de/mrgoomer","title":"Sin tí (Luis Miguel)","lyrics_plain":null,"lyrics_synced":"[00:24.89] Sin ti,\n[00:28.40] no podré vivir sin tí\n[00:33.51] y pensar que nunca más\n[00:38.62] estaras junto a mí.\n[00:45.32] Sin ti,\n[00:48.83] que me puede ya importar,\n[00:53.94] si lo que me hace llorar\n[00:59.04] esta lejos de aquí\n[01:05.74] Sin ti,\n[01:09.26] no hay clemencia en mi dolor,\n[01:14.52] la esperanza de mi amor\n[01:18.67] te la llevas al fin.\n[01:26.01] Sin ti\n[01:29.68] es inútil vivir,\n[01:34.95] como inútil será\n[01:39.89] el quererte olvidar.\n[02:06.86] Sin ti\n[02:10.53] es inútil vivir,\n[02:15.80] como inútil será\n[02:21.38] el quererte olvidar.\n[02:27.29] Sin ti\n[02:30.96] es inútil vivir,\n[02:36.22] como inútil será\n[02:41.81] el quererte olvidar.\n","lyrics_synced_enhanced":"[00:24.89] <00:24.89>Sin <00:25.53>ti,\n[00:28.40] <00:28.40>no <00:28.79>po <00:29.36>dré <00:29.67>vi <00:29.99>vir <00:30.34>sin <00:30.63>tí\n[00:33.51] <00:33.51>y <00:33.98>pen <00:34.46>sar <00:34.78>que <00:35.10>nun <00:35.42>ca <00:35.58>más\n[00:38.61] <00:38.61>es <00:39.09>ta <00:39.57>ras <00:40.37>jun <00:40.69>to a <00:40.85>mí.\n[00:45.31] <00:45.31>Sin <00:45.95>ti,\n[00:48.82] <00:48.82>que <00:49.15>me <00:49.71>pue <00:50.10>de <00:50.42>ya im <00:50.58>por <00:51.06>tar,\n[00:53.93] <00:53.93>si <00:54.57>lo <00:54.89>que <00:55.21>me ha <00:55.69>ce <00:56.01>llo <00:56.32>rar\n[00:59.04] <00:59.04>es <00:59.52>ta <00:59.99>le <01:00.47>jos <01:00.79>de a <01:01.27>quí\n[01:05.74] <01:05.74>Sin <01:06.38>ti,\n[01:09.25] <01:09.25>no hay <01:09.89>cle <01:10.21>men <01:10.69>cia en <01:11.01>mi <01:11.17>do <01:11.48>lor,\n[01:14.52] <01:14.52>la es <01:14.99>pe <01:15.31>ran <01:15.63>za <01:15.95>de <01:16.27>mi a <01:16.59>mor\n[01:18.67] <01:18.67>te <01:18.98>la <01:19.14>lle <01:20.42>vas <01:21.38>al <01:21.70>fin.\n[01:26.01] <01:26.01>Sin <01:26.80>ti\n[01:29.68] <01:29.68>es <01:30.15>i <01:30.4